// rumors start at rumor number * 20
// the first message is the logbook message
// all others are filled in based on NPC's social class

{0}{There is an orc camp near the river.}
{1}{The filthy orcs are camping by the river!} // noble
{2}{The gods have deemed to allow some orcs to camp near the river.} // priest
{3}{Some orcs camped near the river.} // wizard
{4}{An orc camp is located near the river.} // technologist
{5}{The orc camp near the river is bad for business! They scare away customers.} // shopkeeper
{6}{Orcs are camped near the river. It would be good if someone cleared them out.} // guard
{7}{Some vile orcs are near here, at the river!} // city_dweller
{8}{I wish the orcs would not camp so close. They are at the river.} // villager
{9}{I hear people talking about an orc camp at the river.} // beggar
{10}{There might be loot at the orc camp near the river.} // thief
{11}{I rode past an orc camp near the river.} // bandit
